---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About NOVA and Nova Impact Solutions"
  description="Who makes NOVA, how this site sources its numbers, and how to send a correction."
  path="/about"
>
  <div class="container article-wrap">
    <header class="article-head">
      <h1>About NOVA and Nova Impact Solutions</h1>
      <p class="desc">A veteran-owned software and AI automation company in Florence, Kentucky, building a 24/7 AI receptionist for home service businesses.</p>
    </header>
    <article class="prose">
      <h2>What we do</h2>
      <p>Nova Impact Solutions makes NOVA. NOVA answers inbound calls before they reach voicemail, books appointments, follows up on estimates and unconverted leads, and transfers urgent calls live to a person you choose. It connects with tools like ServiceTitan and AccuLynx, speaks multiple languages, and works with your existing phone number. A person on our team helps you set it up.</p>
      <p>We publish this site to show contractors what unanswered calls cost and how NOVA compares, and to give them a free way to test it.</p>

      <h2>Why you can trust the numbers here</h2>
      <p>We sell NOVA, so we hold ourselves to a standard on everything else we publish.</p>
      <div class="standards">
        <h2>Editorial standards</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Numbers.</strong> We use a figure only if we can name its source and the date we pulled it. If sources disagree, we show the range.</li>
          <li><strong>Competitors.</strong> We describe them from public pages, say what they do well, and write "not found in sources" instead of guessing. Every comparison shows its date.</li>
          <li><strong>Our product.</strong> Claims about NOVA come from Nova Impact Solutions. We do not publish testimonials or case studies unless a named customer has agreed in writing and the date is shown.</li>
          <li><strong>Corrections.</strong> We fix errors and show when each page was last updated.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <h2>Where the county data comes from</h2>
      <p>County business counts come from the US Census Bureau's County Business Patterns and cover establishments with paid employees only. Kentucky rules link to the statute or agency document where we could read it. Missed-call studies are mostly published by companies that sell phone tools, so we show them as a range.</p>

      <h2>What this site is not</h2>
      <p>It is not legal advice. Check anything you rely on with a Kentucky attorney, especially call recording, AI disclosure and text messaging.</p>

      <h2>Corrections and contact</h2>
      <p>If you find a wrong number, an old link or a rule that has changed, email <a href="mailto:info@novaimpactsolutions.com">info@novaimpactsolutions.com</a>.</p>
      <p>Nova Impact Solutions<br />7659 Mall Road, Florence, KY 41042<br /><a href="tel:+18595947440">(859) 594-7440</a><br /><a href="https://novaimpactsolutions.com" rel="noopener">novaimpactsolutions.com</a></p>
    </article>
    <CtaBand where="about" />
  </div>
</Base>
